WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:14.917
Kid 1: Hey, we were playing with that ball!

2
00:00:14.918 --> 00:00:16.989
Danny: Come on, come all!

3
00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:20.371
Gather round for a story that will amaze you!

4
00:00:20.372 --> 00:00:23.761
Kid 2: What is he talking about?

5
00:00:23.762 --> 00:00:33.015
Danny: This is the incredible tale of Danny and the Colorless Giants!

6
00:00:33.016 --> 00:00:34.957
Brad: Uh-oh.

7
00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:40.619
Danny: Once upon a time, there was an evil giant named Tristay.

8
00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.037
Tina: Danny, be quiet!

9
00:00:43.038 --> 00:00:46.839
Danny: A friendly giant named Hopian came to me.

10
00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:53.549
Danny: He asked me to save his world from the evil Tristay!

11
00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:56.508
Tina: Danny, we made a promise not to talk about it.

12
00:00:56.509 --> 00:00:58.603
Brad: People will laugh at us.

13
00:00:58.604 --> 00:00:59.953
Danny: No, they won't.

14
00:00:59.954 --> 00:01:02.077
They'll think we are heroes.

15
00:01:02.078 --> 00:01:04.110
Kids: We want a story.

16
00:01:04.111 --> 00:01:07.879
We want a story.

17
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:11.527
Danny: I magically traveled to a strange world.

18
00:01:11.528 --> 00:01:17.889
Danny: I survived dangerous waters, freezing cold, and a horrible monster.

19
00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:20.359
Chuck: Do you believe this guy?

20
00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:23.302
Dave: I think we should shut him up.

21
00:01:23.303 --> 00:01:26.803
Danny: Then, using my powerful imagination . . .

22
00:01:26.804 --> 00:01:28.682
Tina: Danny! Stop!

23
00:01:28.683 --> 00:01:33.508
Chuck: Ha-ha! Even your girlfriend doesn't believe you.

24
00:01:33.509 --> 00:01:37.116
Dave: You should stop making up stories.

25
00:01:37.117 --> 00:01:42.073
Tina: Remember last time?

26
00:01:42.074 --> 00:01:43.863
Chuck: We're not scared.

27
00:01:43.864 --> 00:01:46.037
It’s two against one.

28
00:01:46.038 --> 00:01:51.121
Dave: Yeah. Your friends are too scared to fight us.

29
00:01:51.122 --> 00:01:52.638
Danny: I’m not scared.

30
00:01:52.639 --> 00:02:02.100
I defeated the evil giant Tristay!

31
00:02:02.101 --> 00:02:04.584
Dave: That's for telling lies!

32
00:02:04.585 --> 00:02:07.363
Danny: I was not telling lies!

33
00:02:07.364 --> 00:02:10.719
Dave: You never traveled to a magic world.

34
00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:15.656
Chuck: And you didn't fight an evil giant.

35
00:02:15.657 --> 00:02:21.765
Danny: I did! You can ask these two!

36
00:02:21.766 --> 00:02:24.191
Dave: So? Is he telling the truth?

37
00:02:24.192 --> 00:02:30.340
Chuck: Yes, is he telling the truth?

38
00:02:30.341 --> 00:02:37.684
Danny: Fine! If you won’t tell them, I will.

39
00:02:37.685 --> 00:02:42.321
Danny: It's true. I defeated an evil giant with magic powers.

40
00:02:42.322 --> 00:02:43.415
Kid 1: How?

41
00:02:43.416 --> 00:02:46.173
Danny: My imagination was the key.

42
00:02:46.174 --> 00:02:51.097
Danny: At one point, we had to fight a giant dragonfly!

43
00:02:51.098 --> 00:02:55.604
Kid 3: Wow.

44
00:02:55.605 --> 00:02:58.111
Tina: Come on, Danny. Let's go.

45
00:02:58.112 --> 00:03:00.746
Danny: No. They love this story.

46
00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:02.895
And I'm going to tell it.

47
00:03:02.896 --> 00:03:07.527
Brad: We warned you.

48
00:03:07.528 --> 00:03:11.906
Danny: The dragonfly attacked us near a blue stream.

49
00:03:11.907 --> 00:03:23.870
Danny: We hid underwater, holding our breath . . .

50
00:03:23.871 --> 00:03:28.456
Chuck: Ha-ha! That's what you get for telling tales!

51
00:03:28.457 --> 00:03:35.553
Dave: Yeah. You're not brave enough to save anybody!

52
00:03:35.554 --> 00:03:37.142
Chuck: What do you want?

53
00:03:37.143 --> 00:03:39.415
Brad: What you did wasn't nice.

54
00:03:39.416 --> 00:03:43.778
Dave: So what? What can you do about it?

55
00:03:43.779 --> 00:03:45.744
Brad: I’ll get even with you.

56
00:03:45.745 --> 00:03:49.880
Some day, somehow!
